    "title": "Williston city council meeting erupts in heated exchange - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mistie Webb ,\n3 hours ago WILLISTON, Fla. (WCJB) - A Williston City Council meeting turned into a shouting match Tuesday night, ending with one commissioner being escorted out by the police chief. The argument broke out during a discussion about the “Light Up Williston” holiday event this weekend, specifically whether its electrical setup met safety code. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
